<div class="wrap">

  <header class="hero">
    <div class="kicker">Visual Identity System</div>

    <div class="hero-mark-row">
      <div class="hero-tile">
        <svg style="--dot-color:var(--accent)">
          <use href="#ozl-mark"></use>
        </svg>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-word">
        OZL<span>IND</span>
        <svg
          class="dot"
          width="7"
          height="7"
          style="display:inline;vertical-align:top;margin-left:2px"
        >
          <use href="#ozl-node"></use>
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="hero-sub">
      A circle met by a precise cut, rising to a single point beyond its own edge,
      with one node found just past it. Intelligence as the whole; the cut as
      direction and precision; the node as the idea reached through exploration.
      One shape, one accent — everything else in the system is drawn from it.
    </p>
  </header>

  <section>
    <h2 class="section-title">01 — Primary Mark</h2>
    <h3 class="section-sub">Symbol, lockups &amp; variations</h3>

    <p class="lede">
      The mark is a single filled silhouette plus one detached node — no gradients,
      no dimensional effects. It is built once as pure geometry
      (<code>currentColor</code>) so every variation below is the same shape,
      only recolored or recomposed.
    </p>

    <div class="grid-cards">

      <div class="lcard">
        <svg
          width="56"
          height="56"
          style="color:var(--text);--dot-color:var(--accent)"
        >
          <use href="#ozl-mark"></use>
        </svg>

        <div class="lcard-label">Primary symbol</div>
        <div class="lcard-sub">mark + accent node</div>
      </div>

      <div class="lcard">
        <div class="lockup-h">
          <svg>
            <use href="#ozl-mark" style="--dot-color:var(--accent)"></use>
          </svg>
          <span>OZLIND</span>
        </div>

        <div class="lcard-label">Horizontal lockup</div>
      </div>

      <div class="lcard">
        <div class="lockup-v">
          <svg>
            <use href="#ozl-mark" style="--dot-color:var(--accent)"></use>
          </svg>
          <span>OZLIND</span>
        </div>

        <div class="lcard-label">Vertical lockup</div>
      </div>

      <div class="lcard">
        <svg width="48" height="48">
          <use href="#ozl-mark"></use>
        </svg>

        <div class="lcard-label">Symbol-only</div>
        <div class="lcard-sub">no accent — pure silhouette</div>
      </div>

      <div class="lcard">
        <span
          style="font-size:26px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.5px;"
        >
          OZLIND
        </span>

        <div class="lcard-label">Wordmark alone</div>
      </div>

      <div class="lcard">
        <div class="size-row">

          <div class="sizeitem">
            <svg width="16" height="16">
              <use href="#ozl-mark"></use>
            </svg>
            <span class="sizelabel">16</span>
          </div>

          <div class="sizeitem">
            <svg width="20" height="20">
              <use href="#ozl-mark"></use>
            </svg>
            <span class="sizelabel">20</span>
          </div>

          <div class="sizeitem">
            <svg width="24" height="24">
              <use href="#ozl-mark"></use>
            </svg>
            <span class="sizelabel">24</span>
          </div>

          <div class="sizeitem">
            <svg width="32" height="32">
              <use href="#ozl-mark"></use>
            </svg>
            <span class="sizelabel">32</span>
          </div>

          <div class="sizeitem">
            <svg width="48" height="48">
              <use href="#ozl-mark"></use>
            </svg>
            <span class="sizelabel">48</span>
          </div>

        </div>

        <div class="lcard-label" style="margin-top:16px">
          Small-size version
        </div>

        <div class="lcard-sub">
          reads as a solid dot with a single facet at any scale
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lcard">
        <svg
          width="48"
          height="48"
          style="color:var(--text)"
        >
          <use href="#ozl-mark"></use>
        </svg>

        <div class="lcard-label">Monochrome</div>
        <div class="lcard-sub">single ink, no accent</div>
      </div>

      <div class="lcard on-dark">
        <svg
          width="48"
          height="48"
          style="color:#fff;--dot-color:var(--accent)"
        >
          <use href="#ozl-mark"></use>
        </svg>

        <div class="lcard-label">Dark-background version</div>
      </div>

      <div class="lcard on-light">
        <svg
          width="48"
          height="48"
          style="--dot-color:var(--accent)"
        >
          <use href="#ozl-mark"></use>
        </svg>

        <div class="lcard-label">Light-background version</div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="section-title">02 — Wordmark</h2>
    <h3 class="section-sub">OZLIND, set</h3>

    <p class="lede">
      Heavy weight (800), tight tracking, all caps, on a geometric grotesque.
      The one custom device: the brand's accent node stands in for a full stop
      after the wordmark, the same node that appears beyond the logo's cut —
      a small, quiet signature rather than a decorated font.
    </p>

    <div class="lcard" style="max-width:420px;">
      <div class="hero-word" style="font-size:34px;">
        OZL<span>IND</span>
        <svg
          width="8"
          height="8"
          style="display:inline;vertical-align:top;margin-left:3px"
        >
          <use href="#ozl-node"></use>
        </svg>
      </div>

      <div
        class="lcard-sub"
        style="margin-top:14px"
      >
        800 weight · +0.5px tracking · accent node as signature mark
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="section-title">03 — Design System</h2>
    <h3 class="section-sub">Geometry, grid &amp; rules</h3>

    <div class="geo-row">

      <div class="geo-card">
        <h4>Icon grid</h4>
        <p>
          24 × 24 base grid, 20 × 20 live area (2px clear margin on every side).
          All icons are drawn to this grid so they hold consistent optical weight
          from 16px up through 48px+.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="geo-card">
        <h4>Stroke &amp; joins</h4>
        <p>
          1.75px stroke at 24px (scales proportionally with size), round caps,
          round joins throughout. No mixed stroke weights within one icon.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="geo-card">
        <h4>Corner treatment</h4>
        <p>
          Rounded rectangles use a 2.5–3px radius at 24px — soft enough to feel
          human, tight enough to stay precise. Circles and arcs are true circles,
          never ellipses.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="geo-card">
        <h4>Clear space &amp; minimum size</h4>
        <p>
          Clear space around the primary mark equals the mark's own node diameter
          on every side. Minimum digital size: 16px (symbol-only) /
          96px width (horizontal lockup).
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="section-title">04 — Color Tokens</h2>
    <h3 class="section-sub">Neutral system, one accent</h3>

    <p class="lede">
      The interface lives in graphite and off-white. Colour is not a palette to
      decorate with — it is a single warm accent, spent only on the brand node,
      active states and primary actions.
    </p>

    <div class="token-grid">

      <div class="swatch">
        <div class="chip" style="background:#0B0C0E"></div>
        <div class="meta">
          <div class="name">Background</div>
          <div class="hex">#0B0C0E</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="swatch">
        <div class="chip" style="background:#151719"></div>
        <div class="meta">
          <div class="name">Surface</div>
          <div class="hex">#151719</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="swatch">
        <div class="chip" style="background:#25282C"></div>
        <div class="meta">
          <div class="name">Surface Raised</div>
          <div class="hex">#25282C</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="swatch">
        <div class="chip" style="background:#C98A52"></div>
        <div class="meta">
          <div class="name">Accent</div>
          <div class="hex">#C98A52</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="swatch">
        <div class="chip" style="background:#F2F3F4"></div>
        <div class="meta">
          <div class="name">Text Primary</div>
          <div class="hex">#F2F3F4</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="swatch">
        <div class="chip" style="background:#9AA0A6"></div>
        <div class="meta">
          <div class="name">Text Dim</div>
          <div class="hex">#9AA0A6</div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
