    <p class="lede">
      Every icon below is drawn for OZLIND on the grid and stroke rules above —
      none are pulled from Lucide, Material, Font Awesome or any other library.
      <code>currentColor</code> throughout, so a single CSS colour change moves
      the whole set between light and dark themes.
    </p>

